<t tx="ekr.20231106062446.1">def do_promote(p):
    
    # if p.h == h:
        # print(f"Can not promote top level: {p.h}")
        # return

    # Promote if possible.
    if p.numberOfChildren() == 1 and not p.firstChild().h.startswith(('.rs', '.py')):
        # A single organizer node.
        p.setMarked()
        p.promote()
        c.p.expand()
    c.redraw()</t>
<t tx="ekr.20231108013203.1">### Running ruff

After cloning the repository, run Ruff locally from the repository root with:

# Works, but runs *installed* ruff.
cargo run -p ruff_cli -- check c:\Repos\leo-editor\leo\plugins\qt_gui.py --no-cache

### Running unit tests (passes, takes about 30 seconds)

cargo test -q

### Running ruff linting: Instantaneous!

cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings  # Rust linting
</t>
